From c2f6a937cff0c4e7f5795b18f1d652d0133896fd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: painframe <painframe@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 28 Jun 2026 15:20:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] chore: strip Sentry SDK and frontend integration

- Remove NzbDrone.Common/Instrumentation/Sentry/* (SentryTarget, SentryDebounce, SentryCleanser)
- Remove SentryLoggerExtensions, InitializeLogger, ReconfigureSentry
- Remove SentryTargetFixture (referenced removed types)
- Drop Sentry 4.0.2 NuGet from Radarr.Common.csproj
- Drop Sentry* MSBuild props from Directory.Build.props (keep PublishRepositoryUrl + EmbedAllSources for SourceLink)
- Drop FilterSentryEvents from LogOptions + IConfigFileProvider + ConfigFileProvider
- Neutralize WriteSentryWarn callsites in CompletedDownloadService + MediaInfoFormatter
- Drop @sentry/browser + @sentry/integrations from package.json
- Drop createSentryMiddleware.js + Sentry wiring from middlewares.js
- Drop @sentry/browser import + sentry.captureException from ErrorBoundary.tsx
- Add fork notice to README

Stripped at upstream develop c3849dbcb02f6e38cb6206e672ca6e2313962b8c.
GPL-3.0-or-later preserved.
